window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Reyna’s secrets pale in comparison to what Mazrith has been keeping from her. And now that she knows what he is, he has nothing to lose.</p> <p>With the balance of power tipping, both Reyna and Mazrith will be forced to make choices. Save each other, or stop the monsters from ruling Yggdrasil.</p> <p>But love can turn even the sanest crazy, and if they can’t save each other, they may just become the monsters that threaten their world.</p> <p>This is the fourth and final book in the Shadow Bound Queen series, which is an adult fantasy romance inspired by Norse mythology. It is a slow-burn, enemies-to-lovers romance, packed with magic, mystery, and, above all, delicious romantic tension.</p>"; 
